#### Update Task

```
PUT /api/tasks/:id
```

**Request Body:** (all fields optional — only provided fields will be updated)

```json
{
  "title": "Buy groceries and snacks",
  "completed": true
}
```

**Response (200 OK):**

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Task updated successfully",
  "data": {
    "_id": "6a75ec201c1eaa81e4f5f1b9",
    "title": "Buy groceries and snacks",
    "description": "Milk, eggs, bread",
    "completed": true,
    "createdAt": "2026-08-07T14:30:56.298Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-08-07T14:32:02.002Z",
    "__v": 0
  }
}
```

---

#### Delete Task

```
