### Error Responses

#### Invalid MongoDB ID (400 Bad Request)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid task ID format"
}
```

#### Unknown Route (404 Not Found)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Route not found"
}
```

#### Server Error (500 Internal Server Error)

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Server error",
  "error": "Error message details"
}
```

## HTTP Status Codes

| Status Code | Description |
|-------------|-------------|
| `200` | Success (GET, PUT, DELETE) |
| `201` | Resource created (POST) |
| `400` | Bad request (invalid ID, missing title) |
| `404` | Resource not found |
| `500` | Server error |

## Task Model

| Field | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|-------|------|----------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | String | Yes | - | Task title |
| `description` | String | No | `''` | Task description |
| `completed` | Boolean | No | `false` | Task completion status |
| `createdAt` | Date | Auto | - | Auto-generated timestamp |
| `updatedAt` | Date | Auto | - | Auto-updated timestamp |

